1817 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Playtest 3\072 Cate\nWas the difficulty appropriate\077\nThe difficulty was fine\054 there were no failure points for the player\056\n\240\nWhat would you say was the key skill you learned in this level chunk\077 \050Don\031t tell them first\051\nAscending and descending through platforms\056\n\240\nWere you able to learn the skill effectively\077 Why or why not\077\nYes and it was clear on where to go\056\n\240\nDid the design give you any specific ideas or feeling\077 What did it invoke for you\077\nIt felt like climbing through an office building if it was in dead cells\n\240\nAny final thoughts or impressions\077\n\nThe end felt like breaking free)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 1998 0 R
     /Pg 1816 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

