1819 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Playtest 2\072 Conor\n\240\nWas the difficulty appropriate\077\nThe difficulty was sufficient for what we\031re going for in our game\056\n\nWhat would you say was the key skill you learned in this level chunk\077 \050Don\031t tell them first\051\nPlatforming skills\054 mostly jumping\056\n\nWere you able to learn the skill effectively\077 Why or why not\077\nYes\054 the platforms were spaced in such a way that made learning sufficiently challenging\056\n\nDid the design give you any specific ideas or feeling\077 What did it invoke for you\077\nThe first section gave me a very factory esc feeling\054 like everything was the same\056 Kind of maddening if I\031m being honest\054 but that\031s something we could apply to our game maybe\056\n\nAny final thoughts or impressions\077\nI enjoyed the vertical section\054 I think that\031s something our game can really benefit from\056 The sense of moving upwards is a core part of the narrative of our game\056\050\050)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 1820 0 R
     /Pg 1816 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

