1821 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Playtest 1\072 Aiden\050Was the difficulty appropriate\077\050 Yes\054 the difficulty was at a nominal level\056\n\240\nWhat would you say was the key skill you learned in this level chunk\077 \050Don\031t tell them first\051\050 I learnt how to navigate and platform through the level\n\240\nWere you able to learn the skill effectively\077 Why or why not\077\nYes\054 the level design was very straight forward and effectively communicated the skills necessary\054 like jumping\056\n\240\nDid the design give you any specific ideas or feeling\077 What did it invoke for you\077\050 The level invoked a feeling of ease\054 but not too much to where the level is too easy\056\n\240\nAny final thoughts or impressions\077\050 Good design\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 1822 0 R
     /Pg 1816 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

