1823 0 obj
  << /ActualText (One of the primary goals of my testing was to see how the platforming in our version felt in comparison to dead cells\054 especially since platforming is such an important part of dead cells\056 Since that is a huge part of dead cells\031 combat\056 Thus I modeled a section of the level that I had encountered a few times in the game play of dead cells I\031ve played\056)
