1827 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Why did you choose this example\077 What makes it an effective reference for Moontower\077 \050\050This one is a small puzzle\054 I think it makes an effective example of what simple puzzles we may want to implement in moontower\056 The most important part\054 is that it\031s a locked door with an obvious pressure pad to open it\056\n\050 What player skills does this level test\077 Is it at a beginner\054 intermediate or advanced level of difficulty\077 \n\nI would say this is intermediate\054 as there is a puzzle that involves some combat to progress past\056 This is just a basic logic puzzle however\056\n\050 Do the aesthetic elements support the overall level design\077 Why or why not\077 \050Include specific examples to back up your argument\051\056\n\nYes the visuals for the area clearly convey the door is special and has some other method of activting\056)
     /K [ 11 ]
     /P 1828 0 R
     /Pg 1816 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

