1833 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Why did you choose this example\077 What makes it an effective reference for Moontower\077 \050\nThis is a good example of a combat room\054 I chose this due to the multiple variants of enemies present\056 Which makes it a great example for the combat rooms we will have in MoonTower\056\050\050What player skills does this level test\077 Is it at a beginner\054 intermediate or advanced level of difficulty\077 \n\nPurely dodging and combat\054 advanced due to the types and amount of enemies\056\n\050Do the aesthetic elements support the overall level design\077 Why or why not\077 \050Include specific examples to back up your argument\051\056\n\nYes\054 the contrast of the color on enemies vs the rest of the level distinctly seperates them visually\056)
     /K [ 17 ]
     /P 1834 0 R
     /Pg 1816 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

