1835 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Why did you choose this example\077 What makes it an effective reference \nfor Moontower\077 \050\050I chose this due to the vertical platforming in this section\056 This part of the generation I found well suited for the vertical aspect of moontower\056\n\050 What player skills does this level test\077 Is it at a beginner\054 intermediate or advanced level of difficulty\077 \n\nThe skills it tests are the player\031s ability to move around the map vertically\056 As it\031s more of a transition area and there are no enemies or hazards I would say beginner\056\n\050 Do the aesthetic elements support the overall level design\077 Why or why not\077 \050Include specific examples to back up your argument\051\056\n\nI think the aesthetics do support the design\054 due to the lack of bright colors\054 or enemies you can be assured that there is no immediate threat\056)
     /K [ 19 ]
     /P 1836 0 R
     /Pg 1816 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

