1943 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Playtesters\nJohn\nSantiago\nAlex\n\nFirst Playtest\nFeedback\072\nSpeed of vertical ascension is good and matches Dead Cells\056\nThe player takes too long to accelerate downwards after jumping\056\nYou are able to turn around much faster in the air compared to Dead Cells\056\n\nIteration 2\nAdjustments\072\nIncreased the gravity slightly\056\nIncreased jump force to compensate\056\nReduced the maximum fall speed\056\nGoal\072\nHave the player reach their maximum downwards velocity quicker\054 but slow that maximum so that they fall at a consistent and predictable speed\056\nFeedback\072\nMuch improved and more Dead Cells\055accurate\056\nOverall air time in jumps feels appropriate\nFall speed is reasonable\054 where the player would have time to see a few elements of the environment coming should they fall a large distance\056\nFeels incomplete without the ledge climbing mechanic\054 which is to be expected since this exercise only focuses on the running and jumping\056)
     /K [ 127 ]
     /P 1944 0 R
     /Pg 1816 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
